<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | Buy Better Finds"
  description="Learn how Buy Better Finds uses affiliate links and how those links may support the site."
>
  <article class="article">
    <div class="eyebrow">Transparency</div>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lead">Buy Better Finds may earn a commission when you purchase products through certain links on this website. These commissions do not increase the price you pay.</p>

    <h2>Amazon Associates disclosure</h2>
    <p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p>

    <p>Some product links on Buy Better Finds may be special affiliate links. When you click an affiliate link and complete a qualifying purchase or other qualifying action, we may receive compensation from the retailer or affiliate program.</p>

    <p>Our recommendations are intended to provide useful product information and comparisons. Compensation does not guarantee that a product will be recommended, ranked, or described positively.</p>

    <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, shipping costs, promotions, specifications, and other product information can change. Always verify current information on the retailer's product page before purchasing.</p>

    <h2>Link-level disclosure</h2>
    <p>Where affiliate links are used, we may identify them near the recommendation with language such as <strong>Paid link</strong> or another clear affiliate disclosure.</p>

    <h2>Independent recommendations</h2>
    <p>Buy Better Finds is an independent product-discovery website. We do not claim that any retailer, manufacturer, or affiliate network endorses or sponsors Buy Better Finds unless expressly stated.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
